{"title":"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems\"> 2021 CMC 12A #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_10A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 10A Problems (page does not exist)\"> 2021 CMC 10A #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two circles of equal radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> have an overlap area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6feea94b21a7db3646d7529bb4d7d1a0d88a48b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\pi$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> and the total area covered by the circles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/0416ff27b1dfb17b672a12d0314ec8bfd9fe8b77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\pi$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/1/c617eb6b5efc589d5a23ade96d615afb3c4a4977.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 2\\sqrt{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 2\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 4\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 5\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 4\\sqrt{2}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"426\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of one of the circles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d0102c14b6d25b40c73f81f0cab79687fffeaf1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{25\\pi+7\\pi}{2}=16\\pi.\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"37\" /> The radius of a circle with area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/6/a8614a7ac3a38794811c563d39185fa13a00d684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/c/88cfe513eb8c018f4f918d63b4f244a861f9558a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H4uIpLB-6Jo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H4uIpLB-6Jo</a>\n</p><p>~Punxsutawny Phil\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A\">2021 CMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=2021\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><